{
  "name": "Eldritch Armor",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Action, you can touch a suit of armor that isn't being worn or carried by anyone and instantly don it, provided you aren't wearing armor already. You are proficient with this suit of armor until it's removed.</p><p>You also gain the benefits of the Armor Mastery for this armor, as per the Martial Mastery class feature.</p>",
